@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Our Heritage | Our Dried Fish®</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">
    <div class="site-container">
        <!-- Page Title matching Desktop-2.png -->
        <h1 class="page-title">ABOUT</h1>

        <!-- Our Story Section -->
        <div class="story-section">
            <div class="story-sidebar">
                <span class="section-label">OUR STORY</span>
            </div>

            <div class="story-main">
                <!-- Founder Spotlight -->
                <div class="founder-card">
                    <div class="founder-img-wrap">
                        <img src="images/owner-lily-smith.png" alt="Lily Smith, founder of Our Dried Fish" class="founder-img" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="founder-meta">
                        <h2 class="founder-name">LILY SMITH</h2>
                        <span class="founder-role">Owner & Founder</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Foundation Dedication Headline -->
                <h2 class="dedication-headline">
                    Our Dried Fish was founded in honor of Lily Smith’s loving aunts, Teresa and Beth.
                </h2>

                <!-- 3-Image Showcase Row matching Desktop-2.png -->
                <div class="story-photo-trio">
                    <div class="trio-item">
                        <img src="images/products/fish-tocino.png" alt="Fish tocino sweet cured fillets" class="trio-img" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="trio-item">
                        <img src="images/products/dried-katambak.png" alt="Artisanal dried katambak whitefish" class="trio-img" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="trio-item">
                        <img src="images/products/dried-flounder.png" alt="Delicate cured dried flounder flatfish" class="trio-img" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Narrative Body Text -->
                <div class="narrative-block">
                    <p>
                        Lily's journey with dried fish began in the heart of Cebu, Hagnaya, amidst the flourishing waters of her aunts' coastal fish racks. It was there, surrounded by the abundance of nature and the gentle salt breeze, that she discovered her passion for dried fish. From learning the names and characteristics of each coastal fish to understanding the delicate balance of solar curing and sea salinity, she absorbed the artistry of drying fish like the rich Philippine sea.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Our Dried Fish is the expression of that lifelong passion—a place where her love for dried fish translates into beautifully curated dishes, pure natural preparations, and selections that bring timeless joy and authentic flavor to your table.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Wide Breakfast Platter Banner matching Desktop-2.png -->
                <div class="breakfast-banner-wrap">
                    <img src="images/service-native-delicacies.png" alt="Philippine breakfast platter with dried fish, garlic rice, fried eggs, and spicy vinegar dip" class="breakfast-banner-img" loading="lazy" />
                </div>

                <!-- Closing Narrative & Consultation Action -->
                <div class="closing-narrative-block">
                    <p>
                        From humble beginnings, Our Dried Fish has grown into a beloved local destination, known for its flavorful dried fish, personal service, and commitment to quality.
                    </p>
                    <p class="closing-subtext">
                        Discover how we can add a touch of natural flavor to your next meal.
                    </p>
                    <div class="about-action">
                        <a href="/contact" class="btn-pill">BOOK A CONSULTATION</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
